sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant R as Redis
    participant C1 as Consumer 1
    participant C2 as Consumer 2

    Note over P,C2: Critical events go to Streams
    P->>R: XADD critical:events * type payment amount 100

    Note over P,C2: Notifications broadcast via Pub/Sub
    P->>R: PUBLISH notifications "New payment processed"

    R->>C1: Pub/Sub message
    R->>C2: Pub/Sub message

    C1->>R: XREADGROUP GROUP processors C1 STREAMS critical:events >
    R->>C1: Return payment event
    C1->>R: XACK critical:events processors <ID>